{
  "variants": [
    {
      "actionType": "skill_unlocked",
      "actionTag": "zonetransferkit",
      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> Before I write a word about the plant boundary, I need to know what our own nameserver says about us. It holds every name in <b>hallowayprecision.com</b>, and copying that zone is supposed to be a private handover between it and our secondaries.\n\nThere is a kit in the lab built for making that request properly, and for checking what comes back against the address space we actually pay for.",
      "taskInstructions": "Open the Lab panel and review the Zone Transfer Kit capability and cost.",
      "taskQuestion": "Unlock the Zone Transfer Kit in the Lab panel.",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> Zone Transfer Kit is ready. Test the transfer and compare returned addresses with our documented allocations."
    },
    {
      "actionType": "skill_unlocked",
      "actionTag": "zonetransferkit",
      "persona": "Blackhat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Reyes Calloway:</b> Walking a network host by host is for people who bill by the hour. A nameserver that was never told which machines may copy its zone will recite the whole thing to anyone who asks in the right dialect, and I have yet to meet a plant that got that setting right.\n\nWhat you want is the kit that makes that request cleanly and then tells you which of the answers are genuinely theirs.",
      "taskInstructions": "Open the Lab panel and review the Zone Transfer Kit capability and cost.",
      "taskQuestion": "Unlock the Zone Transfer Kit in the Lab panel.",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Reyes Calloway:</b> Zone Transfer Kit is ready. Pull the current zone and separate confirmed records from ownership assumptions."
    },
    {
      "actionType": "skill_unlocked",
      "actionTag": "zonetransferkit",
      "persona": "Hacktivist",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Priya Nandan:</b> A published name outside Halloway's allocation would expand the investigation, but it would not by itself prove a route into the plant. Zone Transfer Kit will give us the records needed for a precise follow-up.",
      "taskInstructions": "Open the Lab panel and review the Zone Transfer Kit capability and cost.",
      "taskQuestion": "Unlock the Zone Transfer Kit in the Lab panel.",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Priya Nandan:</b> Zone Transfer Kit is ready. Document the returned records before drawing conclusions about the endpoints."
    }
  ],
